ATTRIBUTION
-----------
This pipeline is a derivative work of CreelEstimates, the Washington Department
of Fish and Wildlife freshwater creel estimation framework:

    https://github.com/dfw-wa/CreelEstimates   (licensed GPL-3.0)

The Bayesian state-space (BSS) and point-estimator (PE) methodology, the project
structure, and substantial portions of the R and Stan source originate in
CreelEstimates and remain copyright their authors under GPL-3.0. Coastal-Rec-
Crab-BSS adapts that framework to the recreational Dungeness crab fishery:
gear-deployment effort units, a gear-resolved per-gear CPUE model, boat-trailer
effort, ingress/egress day-length handling, and related changes, by WDFW.

