The points behind C1 to C4, as originally written:
  * the exact copyright holder(s) and year(s) named above;
  * whether individual CreelEstimates authors should be named here in addition
    to the CreelEstimates project/URL;
  * that GPL-3.0 is the intended license for this derivative (it must be, since
    CreelEstimates is GPL-3.0 and this is a derivative work);
  * the license VERSION election. This project is marked GPL-3.0-ONLY ("version 3
    of the License", with no "or (at your option) any later version" clause). That
    matches CreelEstimates, whose repository ships only the GPL-3.0 license text
    with no "or later" grant in any source file, README, or DESCRIPTION; a
    derivative of v3-only code cannot itself offer the "or later" option on the
    upstream portions, and v3-only is in any case a valid election even if upstream
    were v3-or-later. If the CreelEstimates authors confirm they intended
    "GPL-3.0-or-later", the headers, this NOTICE, and LICENSE can be switched to the
    "or later" wording; until then, v3-only is the accurate and conservative choice.


